# Conformance probe pack for the `text` wire (spec 0.10). Public. A
# fixed-width record: `delimiter none`, so the record is field 0 and every
# locator is a column. Exercises padding of text and numbers, trimming on
# decode, a gap between columns, and a column the record does not reach.
format        conformance-text-fixed
version       0.10.0
distribution  public
source        "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses          probe
wire          text
delimiter     none

field  uid       0:0:6     string
field  probe.n   0:6:5     int
field  lat       0:11:8    dec:4
field  probe.s1  0:20:4    string
field  probe.x   0:24:3    int:2
